{"path":"/ru/tip/01-41","title":"Перед выходом на дикий лёд необходимо просверлить отверстия и измерить его толщину — не стоит выходить, если она меньше 15 см. Избегайте льда на реках и вблизи лунок для ловли рыбы | HowToLiveBetter","description":"Официальные российские рекомендации гласят, что для безопасного катания взрослым людям толщина льда должна составлять минимум 15 см. В США и Канаде м…","lang":"ru","styles":["/sites/howtolivebetter/styles/bca54bebe9c1bd3b.css"],"bodyClass":"font-sans antialiased","nodes":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-site"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-slot","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[]},{"tag":"header","props":{"className":"life-header"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-inner"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-brand","aria-label":"H ✳ HowToLiveBetter — главная","href":"/ru"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-brand-mark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["H",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["✳"]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["HowToLive",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Better"]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-nav","aria-label":"Основная навигация"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ru/book"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Книга"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ru/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Топ-50"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ru/daily"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Задание дня"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ru/dashboard"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Мой список"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-nav-link life-nav-more","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Ещё"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"htt